# Netlify redirects file

# Redirect HTTP to HTTPS
http://novorasolutions.com/* https://novorasolutions.com/:splat 301!
http://www.novorasolutions.com/* https://novorasolutions.com/:splat 301!
https://www.novorasolutions.com/* https://novorasolutions.com/:splat 301!

# SPA routing - send app routes to index.html (static files served first)
/images/*  /images/:splat  200
/assets/*  /assets/:splat  200
/*    /index.html   200